### Health-like check: list subjects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subjects

### Demo students
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students

### Concept list
GET http://localhost:8080/api/concepts?subjectId=1

### Diagnostic questions (correct answers are not exposed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/quiz/diagnostic?subjectId=1

### Submit example answers - replace question IDs if your database differs
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quiz/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "subjectId": 1,
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": 1, "selectedOption": "A" },
    { "questionId": 2, "selectedOption": "B" },
    { "questionId": 3, "selectedOption": "B" }
  ]
}

### Mastery
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/mastery?subjectId=1

### Recommendation
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/recommendations?subjectId=1

### Graph
GET http://localhost:8080/api/subjects/1/graph?studentId=1

### Progress metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/progress?subjectId=1
